IMPORT `lfr-relief`

-- Local Forces (Relief of Financial Hardship) Act 1953, ss 2-7 and the Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_local-forces-relief-of-financial-hardship-act-1953.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Days are plain numbers on one calendar: e.g. a date appointed on day 100 and a cessation from day 200.

